    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's just that \"small things\" dont really matter when the big things are so heavy. like, even if i catch up on sleep or whatever, the debt is still there and the career i spent years building is basically dead. it feels like no matter what i do, i'm just digging a deeper hole. it's like i'm stuck in this loop where the harder i fight, the worse it gets. i just feel so pointess.",
